# Optional environment inherited by Codex/Claude subprocesses.
#
# Keep this file minimal. Prefer each provider's native configuration and
# authentication files. Use this only for values that the same user normally
# receives through its interactive environment (for example an HTTP proxy or
# an API endpoint override).
#
# Install as:
#   ~/.config/serverfs-agent-bridge/provider.env
# owned by the current user, mode 0600.
#
# Examples:
# PATH=/home/<bridge-user>/.local/bin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin
# HTTPS_PROXY=http://proxy.example:1080
